，有罪，國除。至孝景中二年，封緤子居代侯。至元鼎三年，居為太常，有罪，國除。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"孝文","kind":"person","person_id":"a85_9d6_72h-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"緤","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"貞侯","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"孝景","kind":"person","person_id":"a7m_i4f_cv4-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"緤","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"居","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m012-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"居","kind":"person","person_id":"fvm_66f_0k3-B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-098-fujin","book_id":"b-shiji-098","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-098-fujin"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:p013","text":"太史公曰：陽陵侯傅寬、信武侯靳歙皆高爵，從高祖起山東，攻項籍，誅殺名將，破軍降城以十數，未嘗困辱，此亦天授也。蒯成侯周緤操心堅正，身不見疑，上欲有所之，未嘗不垂涕，此有傷心者然，可謂篤厚君子矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"00c_o71_46y-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m013-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"陽陵侯","kind":"person","person_id":"w8j_vnd_rs4-","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-098-fujin:m013-0008","start":8